Package: weftdb
Type: Package
Title: Client for the WeftDB Time-Series Server
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Justin", "Icenhour", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "justin@eggersmannusa.com")
Description: Reads and writes WeftDB stored series over the weft-server HTTP API
    as Apache Arrow tables: stored windows and value bands, stored downsampling,
    interpolation, and lossless ingest from data frames or Arrow tables.
License: MIT + file LICENSE | Apache License 2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    arrow (>= 14.0.0),
    bit64 (>= 4.0.0),
    curl (>= 5.0.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/basic-automation/weftdb
BugReports: https://github.com/basic-automation/weftdb/issues
